WEBVTT

00:03:56.850 --> 00:04:01.629
to live with reduced distance
to other activities.

00:04:02.097 --> 00:04:06.818
Third, solidarity:
to create links between people.

00:04:08.167 --> 00:04:13.836
Finally, participation
should actively involve citizens

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:17.311
in the transformation
of their neighborhood.

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.816
Don't get me wrong --

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:23.573
I'm not angling for cities
to become rural hamlets.

00:04:24.601 --> 00:04:28.289
Urban life is vibrant and creative.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:34.890
Cities are places of economic
dynamism and innovation.